{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "00c03183d811b49faf230dfa74e5f7ac39dba0656755083ec1201ba07dda185a", "ja": "（アイドル達のサマーフェスが終わり……ロコは空の\nステージをキャンバスに、楽しそうに絵を描いた）", "zh": "（偶像们的夏日祭典结束后……ROCO把空荡荡的舞台当作画布，开心地画起了画。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5ce9adf2ad83e883a903fd53193d2afb6051f1b838666b9bf0754d395a7fe12b", "ja": "コラボレーションしようって誘われたけど、\nロコの絵を邪魔してしまいそうだしな……そうだ。", "zh": "有人邀请我一起合作来着，可是感觉会妨碍到ROCO的画……对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "28ab39e064a8f518e507bf68e7a97f5e47d594e57eb28d9d42e602251a8c38cf", "ja": "お待たせしました、{$P$}！\nペンキを落とすのに、時間がかかってしまいました。", "zh": "让您久等了，{$P$}！\n为了把油漆洗掉，花了点时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1004_p", "source_sha256": "966180c8c20029dd56c3611e8f3fc39b13b9358ea2532593e338a5a8f41957ee", "ja": "お疲れさま、ロコ。\n別に急いでないし、大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，ROCO。\n我又没着急，没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "239f9926f7c986d7149060260b929f2675b654ce12b90b01d172c1fc81d7ffc7", "ja": "あれ？　{$P$}。\n壁の隅っこに、何か書いてありますよ。", "zh": "咦？{$P$}。\n墙角写着什么东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "fab3759c140a90ef797885280a468a10663303751583a6aeabb79603af361861", "ja": "これ、ロコの名前ですね。\nアンナやアリサ、マミ……コトハ達の名前もあります。", "zh": "这个是ROCO的名字呢。\n还有杏奈、亚利沙、真美……琴叶她们的名字。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "bfeeeb9228a5640b203af10a836cc90e89d6972acbc104bf94830a4691237514", "ja": "{$P$}が書いたんですか？", "zh": "是{$P$}写的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7d1888ff2deda9aff15bfb0ed76bdccb3c540898e230fecc626e1812d1053a4c", "ja": "ああ。さっき、コラボレーションしようって誘って\nくれただろ？　でもロコみたいには描けないから……。", "zh": "啊。刚才，你邀请我一起合作来着吧？\n不过我画不出像ROCO那样的画，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ac52e2bd83430ab2ac6f944e0f8af38787fbb4f2e80192f8220348c3f02adbb6", "ja": "今日のライブに出演したみんなの名前を書いたんだ。\nアートというには程遠いけど、思い出にはなったかな？", "zh": "我把今天演出的大家的名字写下来了。\n虽然离艺术还差得远，但也算留下回忆了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "89f279e2a1e2540a3d4bb72683045029b2514b1e8f764247062446e80865babb", "ja": "アートじゃないなんて、そんなことないですよ、\n{$P$}！　ロコは……ロコは……。", "zh": "怎么能说不是艺术呢，才不是那么回事呢，{$P$}！ROCO呢……ROCO呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "5d07ba79c71e617c24bc1911d3b8311ecba332275a755b3e2132709ad681409d", "ja": "ロコは今、\nディープなエモーショナルを感じています～！", "zh": "ROCO现在感受到了深沉的情感～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cfba41334f104963d5b731eeaf433e9743d20f9b333895941702bb52988dac01", "ja": "そ、そうか？", "zh": "会、会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "0fda8567381d9a87a20a322349ba604550696dcdb05ed5996660cba1f1bb9d72", "ja": "はい！　アートにテクニックはもちろん大事ですけど、\nやっぱりソウルがないとってロコは思うの！", "zh": "是的！艺术当然也很需要技巧，不过ROCO觉得，果然还是不能没有灵魂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "ca4f25a6ec24d4a97a149a22adde3178ede3a66c1c9a463c36e4430a45173a38", "ja": "何より{$P$}が\n書いてくれたってことが、エキサイティングなんです！", "zh": "最重要的是，{$P$}愿意为我们写下这些，实在太让人兴奋了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "cc2cca0c676addf554008eda52f244b6207636520dd2674ba2f9cfc71cba2b6b", "ja": "だって、ロコたちのステージとアートが\n{$P$}に火をつけたんですから！", "zh": "因为，是ROCO们的舞台和艺术点燃了{$P$}啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1017_p", "source_sha256": "089627240fe99bb95648d76601b4ea0a8e7935842df6df635014fa02621213c6", "ja": "火をつけた……なるほど、確かにそうかもしれない。\n衝動が、今回は文字になった……というわけか。", "zh": "点燃了火焰……原来如此，确实有可能。\n也就是说，这次是冲动化作了文字……对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "0061d6b3a849b6230b37a572cf7972ae7efab1a47ffc7e62138b5ee1c19e2820", "ja": "はい！　ステージとアートに{$P$}の\nハートが動いて、この文字が生まれたんですよ♪", "zh": "是的！舞台和艺术触动了{$P$}的心，于是才有了这些文字哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "0c57dd7e3fad43ff7509e5f7812c9d63a6f5d9db9bed44e9bcc3a4f38d899c64", "ja": "ロコは今、最高にハピネスです♪\nこの壁、持って帰れないでしょうか……。", "zh": "ROCO现在幸福到极点了♪\n这面墙，应该没法带回去吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1020_p", "source_sha256": "685b4a674438bca31ce5c48919a18dbc92e4e4d21d045a62fa314d883585b935", "ja": "壁を持って帰るのは、流石に無理かな……\n記念に、写真を撮って帰ろう。", "zh": "把墙带回去，实在是不太可能吧……\n拍张照片留个纪念带回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0173_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "440cdec88fe8382bbb12c965c67dc20af6e0c6d4bf47ec1ae3f6fda1a0ba5277", "ja": "そうですね！　サマーフェス、スペシャルな\nメモリーができました……えへへ♪", "zh": "是啊！这次夏日庆典，留下了一段特别的回忆……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
